<h3><u>Amma achi amma</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Amma achi amma</u></strong></p>

<p>Dakhil jo madine me huwe ahl-e-madina</p>

<p>Jaate huwe kuch aur the ab kya hai karina</p>

<p>Na Akbaro Abbas na Hamrah Sakina</p>

<p>Aur gham se har ik bibi ka labrez tha sina</p>

<p>Jab ghar ke karib aagayi kunbe ki sawaari</p>

<p>Sughra ne jo dekha to ye, roro ke pukaari</p>

<p>Amma, amma</p>

<p>Hay (Amma achi amma mera kunba kaha hai, amma achi amma mera baba kaha hai) x3</p>

<ol>
 <li>Sughra, kya puch liya Sughra tune, sab kuch to ayaa hai chehre se, le dekh safed yeh baal mere, mat puch kaha hai ab kunba
 <p>(Amma achi amma mera kunba kaha hai, amma achi amma mera baba kaha hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Sughra, jis jaan se pyaara kehti thi, din jis ke liye tu ginti thi, be goro kafan hai baba tera, mat puch kaha hai ab kunba
 <p>(Amma achi amma mera kunba kaha hai, amma achi amma mera baba kaha hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Sughra, jis kunbe ko tu puchti hai, wo karbobala ki khaak huwa, sab chand chupe karbal me tere, mat puch kaha hai ab kunba
 <p>(Amma achi amma mera kunba kaha hai, amma achi amma mera baba kaha hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Sughra, wo eik zaeef jawaan jo hai, pehchaan isse Sajjad hai ye, Isse shaam ki galiya maar gayi, mat puch kaha hai ab kunba
 <p>(Amma achi amma mera kunba kaha hai, amma achi amma mera baba kaha hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Sughra, wo Asghar jo cheh maah ka tha, wo bhi na raha, wo bhi na raha, maa dhoop me baythi roti hai, mat puch kaha hai ab kunba
 <p>(Amma achi amma mera kunba kaha hai, amma achi amma mera baba kaha hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Sughra, jab shaam-e-ghariba ayi thi, Zainab pe bari tanhaayi thi, ghar jalta that chinti thi rida, mat puch kaha hai ab kunba
 <p>(Amma achi amma mera kunba kaha hai, amma achi amma mera baba kaha hai) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Sughra, darti thi andhere se jo bahot, wo bali Sakina teri behen, ab tak hai wo zindaa mei Sughra, mat puch kaha hai ab kunba</li>
</ol>

<p>(Amma achi amma mera kunba kaha hai, amma achi amma mera baba kaha hai) x2</p>
